Z||000001||fierosound||02-24-2001||10:42 PM||||What engine have you got?  3.4L OHV or DOHC or something else again?<BR>We need a few more details here.  But here's stuff to get you started.<BR>I found these with just plain old <A HREF="http://www.yahoo.com" TARGET=_blank>www.yahoo.com</A>   search engine!<P>KC Speed chips  <A HREF="http://www.kcspeed.com/gmbox.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.kcspeed.com/gmbox.htm</A> <BR>JET chips  <A HREF="http://www.jetchip.com/domestic/hpgains.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.jetchip.com/domestic/hpgains.htm</A> <P>3.4L DOHC performance sites:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/ca2/34Performance/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.angelfire.com/ca2/34Performance/</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.twindualcam.com/34eng.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.twindualcam.com/34eng.htm</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://webpages.marshall.edu/~scaggs3/perform.html" TARGET=_blank>http://webpages.marshall.edu/~scaggs3/perform.html</A> <P><BR>Lumina message boards<BR> <A HREF="http://members.boardhost.com/elpedito/" TARGET=_blank>http://members.boardhost.com/elpedito/</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://pub28.ezboard.com/fgmfwdperformancefrm7" TARGET=_blank>http://pub28.ezboard.com/fgmfwdperformancefrm7</A> <P><p>[This message has been edited by fierosound (edited 02-24-2001).]||||reg||10
